onths ended 2026-09-30 revenue was $4.1 billion, up 28.9% from $3.2 billion in the three months ended 2025-09-30.","cites":["KLAC.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","KLAC.d.revenue.2025-07-01.2025-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-30 revenue added up to $14.5 billion (computed from five filed figures), net income to $5.3 billion.","cites":["KLAC.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","KLAC.d.revenue.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","KLAC.d.revenue.2025-07-01.2026-06-30","KLAC.d.revenue.2025-07-01.2026-03-31","KLAC.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","KLAC.d.netinc.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","KLAC.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","KLAC.d.netinc.2025-07-01.2026-06-30","KLAC.d.netinc.2025-07-01.2026-03-31","KLAC.d.netinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $4 billion: operating cash flow of $4.5 billion less capital spending of $475 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["KLAC.d.ocf.2025-07-01.2025-12-31","KLAC.d.ocf.2025-07-01.2025-09-30","KLAC.d.ocf.2025-07-01.2026-03-31","KLAC.d.ocf.2025-07-01.2026-06-30","KLAC.d.ocf.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","KLAC.d.capex.2025-07-01.2025-12-31","KLAC.d.capex.2025-07-01.2025-09-30","KLAC.d.capex.2025-07-01.2026-03-31","KLAC.d.capex.2025-07-01.2026-06-30","KLAC.d.capex.2026-07-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-09-22 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2026 as $30 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $508 million.","cites":["KLAC.pay.peoTotal.2026","KLAC.pay.peoPaid.2026"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $7.1 million in total and $56.3 million actually paid.","cites":["KLAC.pay.neoTotal.2026","KLAC.pay.neoPaid.2026"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $939.21 at the end of FY2026, and $425.88 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["KLAC.pay.tsr.2026","KLAC.pay.peerTsr.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $1.8 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $1.7 billion a year earlier.","cites":["KLAC.deferred.2026","KLAC.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 17,000 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $799,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["KLAC.q.employees","KLAC.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2026 annual report tags restructuring charges of $1.2 million, after $7.7 million in FY2025.","cites":["KLAC.restructuring.2026","KLAC.restructuring.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $1.6 billion in cash and cash equivalents, and $5.9 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebt). Debt less cash was $4.2 billion (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["KLAC.cash.2026","KLAC.debtTotal.2026"]}]},"fin":{"KLAC":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":55,"read":55,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["WALLACE RICHARD P","President and CEO"],["Lorig Brian","EVP, KLA Global Services"],["Higgins Bren D.","EVP & Chief Financial Officer"],["Khan Ahmad A.","President, Semi. Prod. & Cust."],["Wilkinson Mary Beth","EVP, CLO and Secretary"],["Kirloskar Virendra A","SVP & Chief Accounting Officer"],["Hanley Jeneanne Michelle","Director"]],"rows":[["S",0,72014,10731526.28,"2026-11-10","2026-11-10","0001193125-26-458307","2026-11-12",1],["S",0,72019,12378625.72,"2026-09-15","2026-09-15","0001193125-26-393053","2026-09-16",1],["S",1,59586,12401634.18,"2026-08-13","2026-08-13","0001193125-26-352187","2026-08-14",1],["S",2,31500,6610905,"2026-08-12","2026-08-12","0001193125-26-349139","2026-08-13",1],["S",0,87568,17421653.6,"2026-08-11","2026-08-11","0001193125-26-3468