q.riskrwwas.5",0.91]]}}},"quotes":{"KLAC.q.employees":{"c":"KLAC","kind":"employees","n":17000,"quote":"As of June 30, 2026, we had approximately 17,000 regular full-time employees and approximately 200 part-time and temporary employees in facilities located in 18 major regions.","source":"KLAC-0000319201-26-000027","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-08-06","proof":"68171ac2f8d1badf32463d5247c6ea83647d60bdca3449b2159e3518e7a682ca"},"KLAC.q.risk.0":{"c":"KLAC","kind":"risk","quote":"We rely upon critical information systems, including our ERP system, for daily business operations and financial reporting, and system failures, implementation issues, or limited access to critical information could adversely affect our business operations.","source":"KLAC-0000319201-26-000027","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-06","proof":"d419d53675209769fcaa27936445bff1f85ef2e918f5909a81b09f98ed1ecce4"},"KLAC.q.risk.1":{"c":"KLAC","kind":"risk","quote":"Ongoing changes in the technology industry, including AI-related developments and changes in semiconductor manufacturing processes, customer investment patterns and end-market demand, could expose our business to significant risks.","source":"KLAC-0000319201-26-000027","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-06","proof":"e2722fe7f648505973fd24e39c4a0ee933a962228e6b4f7a7a03509cf1603a18"},"KLAC.q.riskgone.0":{"c":"KLAC","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Ongoing changes in the technology industry, as well as the semiconductor industry in particular, could expose our business to significant risks.","source":"KLAC-0000319201-25-000024","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-08","proof":"958bae7d12afdbb8aecf2c782076e5b06f3682ba110b29a6f129c99d8c7974b8"},"KLAC.q.riskrw.0":{"c":"KLAC","kind":"risk","quote":"Disruption of our manufacturing facilities, other operations, suppliers, or customers due to climate change, natural disasters, public health crises, terrorism, acts of war or other catastrophic events could result in order cancellations, delivery delays, supply chain disruption or loss of customers and could seriously harm our business.","source":"KLAC-0000319201-26-000027","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-06","proof":"59b7a6d2ae0a36dd391cf5c7e0a2300e50acf70514be240b23e4ed178ad970be"},"KLAC.q.riskrwwas.0":{"c":"KLAC","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Disruption of our manufacturing facilities or other operations or those of our suppliers, or in the operations of our customers, due to climate change, earthquake, flood, other natural catastrophic events, public health crises or terrorism could result in cancellation of orders, delays in deliveries or other business activities, or loss of customers and could seriously harm our business.","source":"KLAC-0000319201-25-000024","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-08","proof":"0ac29128dead6cc34263d1146e9d0ad73692093803f1b292d66eba0d8d2e3b3e"},"KLAC.q.riskrw.1":{"c":"KLAC","kind":"risk","quote":"Recently announced and future U.S. tariffs, retaliatory trade measures and other trade restrictions, as well as uncertainty regarding tariff authority, implementation and refund processes, may have a material adverse impact on our results of operations.","source":"KLAC-0000319201-26-000027","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-06","proof":"a4b58e0b591da6df87366c8de5d89e3dd416ce02476d5b5c5e56d17952c12036"},"KLAC.q.riskrwwas.1":{"c":"KLAC","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Recently announced and future U.S. tariffs or other restrictions placed on imports, retaliatory trade measures taken by other countries and resulting trade wars may have a material adverse impact on our results of operations.","source":"KLAC-0000319201-25-000024","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-08","proof":"a7adad5752e332810e720079ff1ab3cc15befbf1c19892ad16e30245638f929f"},"KLAC.q.riskrw.2":{"c":"KLAC","kind":"risk","quote":"We are exposed to risks associated with our interest rate hedging activities.","source":"KLAC-0000319201-26-000027","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-06","proof":"7f88f17367110ade8579a451232f9be8e10afbedfcefcb2c5175de14ca844306"},"KLAC.q.riskrwwas.2":{"c":"KLAC","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We are exposed to risks associated with a highly concentrated customer base.","source":"KLAC-0000319201-25-000024","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-08","proof":"a2fff4d6b1679ac01329abd3c21cf46232bce543208a246f7fe1ecec3894743f"},"KLAC.q.riskrw.3":{"c":"KLAC","kind":"risk","quote":"Our business would be harmed if we do not receive parts, materials and subassemblies sufficient in number and performance to meet our production requirements and product specifications in a timely, cost-effective and compliant manner.","source":"KLAC-0000319201-26-000027","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-06","proof":"465db79a1fea52a59383db81c2dc4efac0a524b882698a8daeda001d73ba4272"},"KLAC.q.riskrwwas.3":{"c":"KLAC","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Our business would be harmed if we do not receive parts sufficient in number and performance to meet our production requirements and product specifications in a timely and cost-effective manner.","source":"KLAC-0000319201-25-000024","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-08","proof":"d8ba4d63b7a0373a88e85025d779c4e0cc50b714397f3cee8d950b9dfab0002b"},"KLAC.q.riskrw.4":{"c":"KLAC","kind":"risk","quote":"We are exposed to risks related to the development, adoption, governance and use of AI by us, our competitors and other third parties.","source":"KLAC-0000319201-26-000027","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-06","proof":"5a9f9a3953fead9b24ea5730823d4533f5a30f84f98ba8e7e760bd94e301a256"},"KLAC.q.riskrwwas.4":{"c":"KLAC","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We are exposed to risks related to the use of AI by us, our competitors and other third parties.","source":"KLAC-0000319201-25-000024","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-08","proof":"0a6332540df3807f5ad7f1d8a0b0c4ef171f80d8a932a7bcd5d27d6171a53a59"},"KLAC.q.riskrw.5":{"c":"KLAC","kind":"risk","quote":"Obligations to comply with restrictive and financial covenants as noted in the above risk factor and Note 7 “Debt” to our Consolidated Financial Statements.","source":"KLAC-0000319201-26-000027","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-06","proof":"a22ba68db010d1a461040c2a410cabcc83b8087fcafd14a2ee7fc578a84ddf04"},"KLAC.q.riskrwwas.5":{"c":"KLAC","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Obligations to comply with restrictive and financial covenants as noted in the above risk factor and Note 8 “Debt” to our Consolidated Financial Statements.","source":"KLAC-0000319201-25-000024","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-08","proof":"7f8b6d57a36e62fe34925389bdb9cdec95cc82be4ee2f37f51b4e8ec10434a72"}},"sources":{"KLAC-0000319201-25-000024":{"kind":"prior-annual-report","by":"KLAC","form":"10-K","period":"2025-06-30","date":"2025-08-08","accn":"0000319201-25-000024","title":"KLA 10-K for the fiscal year ended 2025-06-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/319201/000031920125000024/klac-20250630.htm","sha":"f1d3f20a609a5718b725a140d1976fdbd91bbf7c04e68ca91ae173baa5c2722d"}}}